      </div>
      
      <div class="h-full">
        <img
          alt="Lexington thumbnail"
          loading="lazy"
          class="rounded-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50"
          src="/assets/loyalty/customloyalty_1.webp"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24 items-center">
      <div class="sm:order-last  ">
        <h2 class="mt-8 font-medium">
          Configure VIP Tiers
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">Set up landmarks to accomplish VIP status</p>
        <p class="mt-4 ">Encourage your customers to attain the next tier with contesting but achievable milestones!</p>
        <div class="gap-3 mt-10">
        <ul class="list-none" role="list">
            <li>
